th de novo or therapy-related myeloid malignancies. [provided by RefSeq, Jul 2008].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q13206","text":"Putative ATP-dependent RNA helicase that plays various role in innate immunity or inflammation. Plays a role in the enhancement of AIM2-induced inflammasome activation by interacting with AIM2 and stabilizing its protein level (PubMed:32519665). Negatively regulates viral infection by promoting interferon beta production and interferon stimulated genes/ISGs expression (PubMed:36779599)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}